TYPES.md §8.3, §15 (DECISIONS 465): `self is c` in a plain record's field default is `is` on a non-variant: E3605, which comes first; a record has no case, so no E3010 ownCase.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local variant V {
  c
}

local record R {
  a: Int = 1
  b: Bool = self is c
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E3605]  a/a.canon:9:13
  is needs a variant, found a.R

